{{> header}}

<h1>Your Password Was Changed</h1>

<p>Hello {{name}},</p>

<p>This is a confirmation that the password for your account was changed successfully.</p>

{{#if changedAt}}
<p><strong>Changed On:</strong> {{changedAt}}</p>
{{/if}}

{{#if location}}
<p><strong>Location:</strong> {{location}}</p>
{{/if}}

{{#if device}}
<p><strong>Device:</strong> {{device}}</p>
{{/if}}

<p>If you made this change, you can safely ignore this email.</p>

<p><strong>If you did not make this change, secure your account immediately:</strong></p>
<ul>
	<li>Reset your password right away</li>
	<li>Review recent account activity</li>
	<li>Contact support if you need help securing your account</li>
</ul>

{{#if resetPasswordLink}}
<p>
	<a href='{{resetPasswordLink}}'>Reset Password</a>
</p>

<p>Or copy and paste this link into your browser:</p>
<p>{{resetPasswordLink}}</p>
{{/if}}

{{#if supportEmail}}
<p>You can reach us at <a href='mailto:{{supportEmail}}'>{{supportEmail}}</a>.</p>
{{/if}}

{{> footer}}
